1
00:00:00,778 --> 00:00:06,948
This video is for the driver. You don't need an account. You only use your phone camera and one link.

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:12,540
Procurement sends you the Driver tasks link once. Add it to your phone home screen.

3
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:16,380
It shows every box you need to move, from where, and to where.

4
00:00:16,830 --> 00:00:20,833
Every box has a QR sticker with the doctor's name and branch.

5
00:00:20,833 --> 00:00:25,690
When you deliver a box, scan its sticker with the camera. This page opens.

6
00:00:26,143 --> 00:00:31,083
Choose your language at the top: Arabic, English, Bengali or Hindi.

7
00:00:32,562 --> 00:00:36,470
Choose where you delivered the box: the branch or procurement.

8
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:42,142
The destination is chosen for you, and the place where the box already is can't be chosen.

9
00:00:42,592 --> 00:00:49,022
Take a photo of the box. The photo is required. Write your name once; the phone remembers it.

10
00:00:49,474 --> 00:00:56,094
Tap Delivered. The nurse gets a message that the box arrived, and procurement sees it on the boxes page.

11
00:00:56,546 --> 00:01:02,736
That's it: scan, choose the place, photo, your name, then Delivered. Thank you!
